## Основные операции

### - Суммировать по оси

sum_by_axis(matrix_source, axis_to_sum) = summed_matrix
    where
        matrix_source: Matrix(axis_to_sum, ...TAxis)
        summed_matrix: Matrix(...TAxis)
            where
                axis_to_sum: Axis
                TAxis: a1, ... an
                    where
                        a1: Axis
                        ...
                        an: Axis

